urface":"百里奚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0218","start":218,"end":221,"surface":"秦穆姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000391","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000382","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p001","text":"夫學者載籍極博，猶考信於六藝。詩書雖缺，然虞夏之文可知也。堯將遜位，讓於虞舜，舜禹之閒，岳牧咸薦，乃試之於位，典職數十年，功用既興，然後授政。示天下重器，王者大統，傳天下若斯之難也。而說者曰堯讓天下於許由，許由不受，恥之逃隱。及夏之時，有卞隨、務光者。此何以稱焉？太史公曰：余登箕山，其上蓋有許由冢云。孔子序列古之仁聖賢人，如吳太伯、伯夷之倫詳矣。余以所聞由、光義至高，其文辭不少概見，何哉？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"學者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003680","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"虞舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003681","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003681","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"岳牧","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"王者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m001-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"說者","kind